OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe morning will begin dry with
OL,6,Fbright spells. Outbreaks of rain will
OL,7,Fhowever soon spread north, these
OL,8,Fbecoming heavy in places, mainly in
OL,9,Fthe east from the afternoon. The wind
OL,10,Fwill strengthen along the coast from
OL,11,Fthe afternoon.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloudy with outbreaks of
OL,14,Frain, heavy at times at first. The
OL,15,Frain will clear from the west from
OL,16,Flate evening. The strong coastal wind
OL,17,Fwill ease down from late evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
