OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FA dry and bright start will
OL,6,Fsoon be followed by outbreaks of rain
OL,7,Fspreading east, these heavy in places.
OL,8,FThe wind will strengthen from the
OL,9,Fmorning.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FVery
OL,12,Fwindy with locally heavy showers
OL,13,FSunday. Dry and bright morning Monday,
OL,14,Fbecoming breezy with rain later. Very
OL,15,Fwindy with showers Tuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
